Try calling DEC Direct for the keyboard.
 You can build a cable yourself.

On the mmj connector on the VT420,
the pins are as follows:
1 DTR
2 tx +
3 tx -
4 rx -
5 rx +
6 dsr

note the + and -, this is a differential interface. Youll have to wire
one half to the actual pin and the other half of each signal to the RS232
ground, which is pin 7. 

happy hacking,
gregg

