descriptors     4096 
23:20 jaguar_sts:~/test> unlimit
23:21 jaguar_sts:~/test> limit
cputime         unlimited
filesize        unlimited
datasize        1048576 kbytes
stacksize       32768 kbytes
coredumpsize    unlimited
memoryuse       119688 kbytes
vmemoryuse      1048576 kbytes
descriptors     4096 

vmemoryuse and datasize might be the culprits.  Another land, another
time, I saw somebody pointing to 'dxkerneltuner' in a similar context,
but I did not check into that.

