  This may be a little late for an answer...

  No, there is no way to control the selection of the horizontal
  rate on VMS or Digital UNIX.

  The supported video rates for the S3 are:

	Resolution	Vertical	Pixel Freq

	640x480		59.94 (60) Hz	25.18 MHz
			72.79 (72)	31.50		*
	800x600		60.32 (60)	40.00
			71.97 (72)	50.00		*
	1024x768	60.00 (60)	65.00
			70.07 (70)	75.00
			72.00 (72)	74.37		*
	1280x1024	60.10 (60)	110.16
			66.474(66)	119.00
			72.556(72)	131.00		*

  The "*" is the default refresh rate at each resolution.



