Or, better yet, run your own application on each of the platforms you
are evaluating. Benchmarketeering has been elevated to an art form by
numerous hardware vendors; but none of my clients have ever purchased a
machine to run SPEC or TPC numbers. They buy to run apps, and
consequently not benchmarking your specific app on the systems you are
evaluating reflects a lack of due diligence--or an inordinate amount of
trust in marketing hype.

