  Yes, and where to find the FAQ has been covered regularly as well.  :-)
  In general, comp.* FAQs are typically collected into comp.answers, and
  all FAQs into news.answers across all newgroups, and FAQs are also
  gathered at the MIT RTFM site.  Various FAQs are also accessable via
  searches of the newsgroup archives at http://www.dejanews.com/.  The
  comp.os.vms newsgroup has another archive at INFO-VAX.

