:or a good source for dec/vax-station info would be good.

  DECstations have shipped with MIPS and with Intel processors, and
  both of those lines, the VAXstation line, and the Alpha lines have
  all had a variety of models.  (In other words, when posting, please
  specify the exact platform name -- there are a number of rather
  similarly-named platforms -- and also specify the operating system
  and the version.  Thanks!)

:digital dont have much info on legacy stuff!

  There is information available (buried) at the website, and -- as
  you suspected -- there is additional information available via the
  various URLs in the FAQ...  As a starter for old systems:

