The first 21264 SPEC*95 numbers are now posted at
http://www.specbench.org/.

The numbers for a "Compaq Computer Digital AlphaServer 8400 6/575":
 
SPECfp95 47.7 SPECint95  30.3

Availability date is listed as Nov. '98.

Intereresting to compare with a plain old  "Digital Equipment
AlphaServer 8400 5/625":

SPECfp95 20.8 SPECint95 18.4

Both systems have 4 MB of cache. It's not clear what hardware
diffs there are between an 8400 6/575 and an 8400 5/625,
other than the processors.

Impressive numbers for the 21264. One can speculate that the
numbers will get even better as the chip and supporting motherboards
evolve.

