whichsupports a sync_on_green output, which the VRT19-HA needs.  Just add the
line

Option      "sync_on_green"

in your XF86 device definition.  I believe this monitor syncs at about 68kHz
and
72,75Hz, so try modelines which provide this.

Good Luck

