If you look at the machine specs on that page you will
see that the 600 MHz has an 8 Mb L3 cache as opposed
to the 533's 4Mb.  I suspect that the bus speeds to this
cache are also different.  SPEC FP benefits greatly from
an increased cache size.  Just compare any 21164 machines
with 2 Mb and 4 Mb respectively.

Eric Christyi

