I upgraded the AS200 4/233 I bought from Onsale with two 28F020 Flash
ROMs from JDR (www.jdr.com).  The parts I used were manufactured by AMD,
the same as the two 28F020 Flash ROMs soldered on the AS200 motherboard.
They aren't obscure parts by any means.

I just looked up my order.  The exact order number I used was:

	28F020-120JC

I now have both SRM and ARC loaded.

Of course you do this at your own risk.  I don't know if it is
supported or not.
