Chi K. Chan wrote:

> There is a IDE connector port on the Multia 166 ?
> Where ?  Mine is a genuine DEC Multia 166 from onsale.

It's right below the floppy drive: you would put a 2.5" IDE (laptop) drive
below the floppy drive. It's NOT a full-size IDE connecter, but rather the
smaller connector used in laptops. There is no easy way to adapt it for a
standard IDE connector.




