In my experience, it's just a matter of time.  Many, if not most, of the
NetBSD developers used to have Multias, and AFAIK they all fried themselves.

The simplest thing to do is probably to test all of your resistor packs and
see if they've got the right values.  My resistor packs don't show any sign
