Kerry,
 I was able to get the AS200 4/233 running using an IBM DORS-32160 2.1 Gig
SCSI 2 drive but had problems with a Quantum Viking 4.5 SCSI 3 drive.  Both
drives had 50 pin connectors but DEC Unix had problems with the disk label
while trying to install on the SCSI 3 drive.

Adapters are available to connect 68 pin drives to 50 pin cables; but, you
may want to consider using a different drive.





