Richard,

If the lamp flickers on and off, it`s usually because the psu is going
into current limit and shutting down. Disconnect the supply, get a test
lamp and battery (~6volt) and go round the output caps and rectifier
diodes to test for shorts. Caps should show open circuit with a lamp and
diodes lo R one way only...

BTW, watch out for the voltages - discharge _all_ caps before touching
anything.

Chris


